        <obo:IAO_0000115>An  organic heteropentacyclic compound that is naloxone substituted in which the allyl group attached to the nitrogen is replaced by a cyclopropylmethyl group. A μ-opioid receptor antagonist, it is used to treat alcohol dependence.</obo:IAO_0000115>
